# ui/ListSelectionSystem and ui/KeyFocusSystem with scripted input: clicks, toggles, ranges, the
# keys and
# typing, a row scrolled into view, a press beside the rows, a sort, a removal and a lost list
# under a selection, keys a program sets before the rows, two lists passing the keys, a text field
# taking them, the rows' colors, double click, Return, Left and Right, a list with a part of its
# rows.
import SdfText
